'''''Moerckia hibernica''''' (vernacular name: '''Irish ruffwort'''{{citation needed|date=February 2021}}) is a species of [[liverwort]] belonging to the family [[Moerckiaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Moerckia hibernica (Hook.) Gottsche |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2688701 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=12 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

It is native to the [[Northern Hemisphere]].

